!.gitignore
.zig-cache/
zig-out/

# vendor/librats/ is generated, never committed: scripts/fetch-librats.sh
# downloads the prebuilt release (6 MB librats.a + upstream headers) into it, and
# install.sh calls that script. Run it once after a clone, before `zig build`.
# The hand-written librats/util/features.h the release omits lives in
# scripts/librats/features.h (tracked) and is copied in by the same script.
/vendor/
